{"seq":1,"slug":"statistical-simulation","title":"统计与仿真：不用神经网络也能造数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/synthetic-data-generation/methods/statistical-simulation","wordCount":1602,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"统计与仿真-不用神经网络也能造数据\">统计与仿真：不用神经网络也能造数据</h1><p>在 GAN 出现之前，人们已经合成数据几十年了。精算师用蒙特卡洛模拟保单赔付，流行病学家用 agent-based 模型推演传染，工程师用规则引擎生成测试用例。这条&quot;过程与统计驱动&quot;的路线到 2026 年依然是很多生产系统的骨干——它可解释、可控、样本量小也能用，且完全不碰真实个体因而隐私干净。本篇讲透四类经典方法：copula、贝叶斯网络、蒙特卡洛、以及基于规则与代理的仿真。</p>\n<p>相比后面的深度生成模型，这些方法的共同哲学是<strong>把&quot;分布&quot;或&quot;机理&quot;显式写出来</strong>，而不是让黑箱神经网络隐式学。这带来两个好处：你知道数据为什么长这样，且能在没有大量真实样本时靠领域知识补齐。代价是表达力有限，捕捉不了极复杂的高维相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-显式建模分布与机理\">核心概念：显式建模分布与机理</h2><p>四类方法沿&quot;数据驱动 ↔ 机理驱动&quot;谱系排布。copula 与贝叶斯网络偏数据驱动（从样本估参数），蒙特卡洛与仿真偏机理驱动（从规则跑数据），但都不用深度学习。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[真实样本 或 领域知识] --&gt; B{有代表性样本?}&#10;  B --&gt;|有, 学分布| C[Copula&lt;br/&gt;边缘+相关]&#10;  B --&gt;|有, 学依赖结构| D[贝叶斯网络&lt;br/&gt;条件概率表]&#10;  B --&gt;|无, 靠机理| E[蒙特卡洛&lt;br/&gt;已知分布采样]&#10;  B --&gt;|无, 靠机理| F[仿真&lt;br/&gt;规则/代理/物理]&#10;  C --&gt; G[采样得合成数据]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[真实样本 或 领域知识] --&gt; B{有代表性样本?}\n  B --&gt;|有, 学分布| C[Copula&lt;br/&gt;边缘+相关]\n  B --&gt;|有, 学依赖结构| D[贝叶斯网络&lt;br/&gt;条件概率表]\n  B --&gt;|无, 靠机理| E[蒙特卡洛&lt;br/&gt;已知分布采样]\n  B --&gt;|无, 靠机理| F[仿真&lt;br/&gt;规则/代理/物理]\n  C --&gt; G[采样得合成数据]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>建模对象</th>\n<th>需要真实样本</th>\n<th>强项</th>\n<th>弱项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Copula</td>\n<td>边缘分布+相关结构</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>快、可解释、混合列友好</td>\n<td>高阶/非线性相关弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贝叶斯网络</td>\n<td>变量间条件依赖</td>\n<td>需要</td>\n<td>结构可读、可注入因果先验</td>\n<td>结构学习难、连续变量需离散化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒙特卡洛</td>\n<td>已知参数分布</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>完全可控、覆盖极端</td>\n<td>需先验知道分布形态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仿真</td>\n<td>系统机理/个体行为</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n<td>生成现实未发生的场景</td>\n<td>规则错则系统性偏差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"copula-把边缘和相关拆开建模\">Copula：把边缘和相关拆开建模</h2><p>copula 的核心洞见来自 Sklar 定理：任何多元联合分布都能拆成&quot;各变量的边缘分布&quot;加&quot;一个描述它们如何耦合的 copula 函数&quot;。这让你可以分两步造数据——先分别拟合每一列的边缘分布（收入可能是对数正态、年龄可能是某个经验分布），再用一个 copula（最常用高斯 copula）捕捉列与列之间的相关。</p>\n<p>高斯 copula 的做法是：把每列数据通过其累积分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 映射到均匀分布，再映射到标准正态得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_i = \\Phi^{-1}(F_i(x_i))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 空间估一个相关矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span>，采样时从多元正态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{N}(0,\\Sigma)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1474em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 抽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 再逆变换回原尺度。这样边缘分布被精确保留，相关结构由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span> 编码。</p>\n<p>copula 是 SDV 库里 <code>GaussianCopula</code> 合成器的基础，也是很多快速原型的首选：训练秒级、可解释、天然处理连续与有序离散混合。它的短板是高斯 copula 只能表达线性尾部相关，捕捉不了强非线性或多峰联合结构——那正是深度模型 <a href=\"generative-models\">生成模型</a> 与表格专用器 <a href=\"../tabular/tabular-synthesis\">表格数据合成</a> 要接手的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"贝叶斯网络-把依赖画成有向图\">贝叶斯网络：把依赖画成有向图</h2><p>贝叶斯网络用一个有向无环图表示变量间的条件依赖：每个节点是一个变量，边表示直接依赖，联合分布分解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>pa</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(x_1,\\dots,x_n) = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} P(x_i \\mid \\text{pa}(x_i))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pa</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>pa</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pa}(x_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pa</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的父节点集合。学好结构和条件概率表后，按拓扑序逐节点采样即可生成新记录。</p>\n<p>它的独特价值有二：一是<strong>结构可读</strong>，图直接告诉你&quot;什么影响什么&quot;，便于领域专家审查与注入先验；二是它是差分隐私合成里 PrivBayes 方法的基础——通过只保留低阶边缘并加噪，在小隐私预算下往往打败深度模型，详见 <a href=\"../tabular/differential-privacy\">差分隐私合成</a>。局限是结构学习是 NP-难、连续变量通常要离散化。贝叶斯建模的更广背景见跨库 <a href=\"../../bayesian-data-analysis/\">贝叶斯数据分析 hub</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"蒙特卡洛与基于规则的仿真\">蒙特卡洛与基于规则的仿真</h2><p>当你没有真实样本、但懂机理时，就转向纯机理驱动。</p>\n<p><strong>蒙特卡洛</strong>假设你已知各输入变量的分布与它们的函数关系，反复随机采样输入、跑模型、收集输出。金融里模拟资产组合的收益分布、工程里做可靠性分析都靠它。它的强项是能生成现实里极罕见的尾部事件——你只要让采样跑得够多。</p>\n<p><strong>基于规则 / 基于代理的仿真</strong>把系统的运行逻辑编码成规则或自主个体的行为。医疗领域的 Synthea 用临床指南规则生成虚拟病人从出生到死亡的完整就诊史；交通仿真里每辆车是一个代理，按跟驰、变道规则互动，跑出真实里无法安全采集的事故前场景。这类方法完全不碰真实个体，隐私最干净，可控性最强，但<strong>规则写错就系统性偏离现实</strong>，且难以自动捕捉建模者没想到的相关。</p>\n<p>实践中常把仿真与数据驱动混合：仿真造骨架保证约束与因果顺序，再用 copula 或深度模型给细节加纹理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时选统计与仿真\">何时选统计与仿真</h2><ul>\n<li>真实样本很少甚至为零，但有可靠领域知识 → 仿真/蒙特卡洛。</li>\n<li>需要快速可解释的原型、列以连续+有序为主 → 高斯 copula。</li>\n<li>需要专家审查依赖结构或做低预算差分隐私 → 贝叶斯网络。</li>\n<li>数据高维、含复杂非线性/多峰联合、图像文本 → 转向 <a href=\"generative-models\">生成模型</a> 或 <a href=\"llm-generated\">LLM 生成</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>统计与仿真是不用神经网络的经典路线，显式建模分布或机理，可解释、可控、隐私干净。</li>\n<li>Copula 用 Sklar 定理把边缘与相关拆开，快而可解释，但只擅长线性相关。</li>\n<li>贝叶斯网络用有向图编码条件依赖，结构可读，是 PrivBayes 等 DP 方法的基石。</li>\n<li>蒙特卡洛与仿真靠机理造数据，能覆盖极端场景，但规则错就系统性偏差。</li>\n<li>高维复杂相关是它们的天花板，届时交给深度生成模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>兄弟篇：<a href=\"generative-models\">生成模型</a>、<a href=\"llm-generated\">LLM 生成数据</a>、<a href=\"../tabular/tabular-synthesis\">表格数据合成</a>、<a href=\"../tabular/differential-privacy\">差分隐私合成</a></li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../bayesian-data-analysis/\">贝叶斯数据分析 hub</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"统计与仿真：不用神经网络也能造数据","id":"统计与仿真-不用神经网络也能造数据"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：显式建模分布与机理","id":"核心概念-显式建模分布与机理"},{"level":2,"text":"Copula：把边缘和相关拆开建模","id":"copula-把边缘和相关拆开建模"},{"level":2,"text":"贝叶斯网络：把依赖画成有向图","id":"贝叶斯网络-把依赖画成有向图"},{"level":2,"text":"蒙特卡洛与基于规则的仿真","id":"蒙特卡洛与基于规则的仿真"},{"level":2,"text":"何时选统计与仿真","id":"何时选统计与仿真"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"保真-效用-隐私三角：为何不能三项全优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/synthetic-data-generation/foundations/fidelity-utility-privacy"},"next":{"title":"生成模型：GAN、VAE 与扩散的机制对照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/synthetic-data-generation/methods/generative-models"}}